{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 23, :comments ["<b>And you shall block its blockage.</b> And you shall seal its sealing — it shall be sealed and blocked from being enjoyed by us." "<b>Three years it shall be to you blocked.</b> From when does one count for it? From the time of its planting; one might think if he delayed it, after three years it would be permitted — therefore Scripture says ״יִהְיֶה״ — in its existing state it shall be (Sifra)."], :book :leviticus, :voice :rashi, :lang :en, :chapter 19, :notes {}, :source-witnesses nil, :timestamp "2026-08-02T09:07:12.035315404Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}